{"2265170": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Cataclysm Era", "steam_appid": 2265170, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to join our Discord：Dww95Kh6Gj</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >__________________________________________________________________ </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🧭 <strong>Grand Strategy: Build Your Power, Reforge Civilization</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Cataclysm Era </i></strong>offers a dynamic strategic world full of possibilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join an existing faction—or rise as an independent ruler—to conquer the wasteland.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shape the world through <strong>war, diplomacy, trade, and policy.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a <strong>simulated economic ecosystem</strong>, where population, industry, technology, policy, and prices all interact.<br>Every decision you make can bring prosperity—or ruin—to a city.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >⚔️ <strong>Real-Time Tactics: A Fusion of Strategy and Action</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Formation Editor:</strong> Design each squad’s formation freely.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unit Customization:</strong> Equip soldiers with diverse weapons, armor, and gear.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Real-Time Command:</strong> Adapt to terrain, reposition your troops, and overcome crises on the fly.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎯 <strong>Top-Down Shooter: Lead from the Frontlines</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the heat of battle, you are not just a commander—you’re a warrior.<br>Take control of your character in top-down combat, turning the tide with precise maneuvers amidst gunfire and explosions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Progression System:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Develop unique skills and traits to define your playstyle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strengthen yourself through exploration, research, technology, or psychic power.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Awaken extraordinary abilities—use telekinesis to control weapons and objects, unleashing devastating attacks!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >__________________________________________________________________</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Content Warning:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game contains adult themes, including:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blood and violence</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Indirect sexual references</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to join our Discord：Dww95Kh6Gj</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >__________________________________________________________________ </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🧭 <strong>Grand Strategy: Build Your Power, Reforge Civilization</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Cataclysm Era </i></strong>offers a dynamic strategic world full of possibilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join an existing faction—or rise as an independent ruler—to conquer the wasteland.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shape the world through <strong>war, diplomacy, trade, and policy.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a <strong>simulated economic ecosystem</strong>, where population, industry, technology, policy, and prices all interact.<br>Every decision you make can bring prosperity—or ruin—to a city.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >⚔️ <strong>Real-Time Tactics: A Fusion of Strategy and Action</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Formation Editor:</strong> Design each squad’s formation freely.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unit Customization:</strong> Equip soldiers with diverse weapons, armor, and gear.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Real-Time Command:</strong> Adapt to terrain, reposition your troops, and overcome crises on the fly.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎯 <strong>Top-Down Shooter: Lead from the Frontlines</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the heat of battle, you are not just a commander—you’re a warrior.<br>Take control of your character in top-down combat, turning the tide with precise maneuvers amidst gunfire and explosions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Progression System:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Develop unique skills and traits to define your playstyle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strengthen yourself through exploration, research, technology, or psychic power.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Awaken extraordinary abilities—use telekinesis to control weapons and objects, unleashing devastating attacks!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >__________________________________________________________________</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Content Warning:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game contains adult themes, including:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blood and violence</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Indirect sexual references</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Build your forces, conquer cities, and unite the wasteland. Cataclysm Era merges real-time tactics, fast-paced top-down battles, and deep management systems to let you forge a new order from the world’s remains.", "supported_languages": "Simplified Chinese, English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2265170/eb5c65cfd57a1db2bb0ec56ca1925f69f9311865/header.jpg?t=1787798326", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2265170/98929be6f67815329e4b55b791a434d0f5f00